Package: paseo
Version: @VERSION@
Architecture: @ARCH@
Maintainer: @MAINTAINER@
Section: devel
Priority: optional
Homepage: https://paseo.sh
Depends: nodejs (>= 22), git, openssh-client, ca-certificates, procps
Installed-Size: @INSTALLED_SIZE@
Description: Monitor and control local AI coding agents from anywhere
 Paseo runs a daemon that manages AI coding agent sessions and serves a
 browser UI on the same port, so you can drive your development environment
 from any device on your network.
 .
 This package installs the daemon, the paseo CLI and the bundled web UI,
 plus systemd units for running the daemon either as your own login user
 or as a dedicated system service.
 .
 Agent CLIs (Claude Code, Codex, Copilot, OpenCode, Pi) are not bundled and
 must be installed separately.
